 Yogurt","Desserts"],"is_open":true},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"xFvkI8Uf_7NDZbChS6wSYQ","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":1420,"mm_rank":1478,"target_category_support_fraction":0.3333333333333333,"selected_image_count":4,"label_diversity":2,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Ice Cream & Frozen Yogurt","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Desserts","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"xFvkI8Uf_7NDZbChS6wSYQ","review_id":"b2hnD804VKamA-fcHp1gvA","date":"2020-08-28T21:11:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9377719759941101,"text_excerpt":"Cute ice shop tucked away in the Marigny with great off street parking. It's in the neighborhood so you don't have to worry about the hustle and bustle of the busy streets in Nola. We were told that the owner makes all the ice in house which you can tell. The mint chocolate chip, vanilla bean and butterscotch pecan were fantastic. The mint really packed so much flavor and elevated my sundae. Highly recommend this place if your looking for an ice cream that's not overly sugary."},{"business_id":"xFvkI8Uf_7NDZbChS6wSYQ","review_id":"LG5UQwglzdQSWK8QH_tyHA","date":"2021-08-08T20:50:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9358351230621338,"text_excerpt":"The cutest ice cream spot tucked away in the Marigny! We stumbled upon Sundae Best after enjoying a leisurely Saturday walk. I don't know how I had no idea this place existed, but I'm so glad to have found it! The ice cream is SO good. I got a double scoop with Congregation Coffee and Cookies 'n' Creme. It was perfect. Not too sweet and so creamy. You can tell it's handmade and definitely surpasses any ordinary ice cream out there. So glad to have stumbled upon this place!"},{"business_id":"xFvkI8Uf_7NDZbChS6wSYQ","review_id":"bR7M2GOu6qk2luU-RSPrkQ","date":"2020-02-21T03:00:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9319725036621094,"text_excerpt":"Found this small ice cream shop in a residential area of the Marigny through the Joy the Baker blog and I'm so glad I did! Erica the owner is here scooping up her ice cream. She's very generous with tastings and willing to share her story if you ask. We ended up getting a scoop of the queen cake and the roasted strawberry. I'm not usually a strawberry ice cream type of person but hers was roasted in the oven to intensify the flavor and tasted so strongly of fresh strawberries. Probably the best version of that flavor I've had. The ice cream texture was very soft, smooth, and creamy. Almost more like soft serve but firmer. I really enjoyed the velvet silkiness."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"xFvkI8Uf_7NDZbChS6wSYQ","photo_id":"vSfnEUaP_E7wtOfAH5_vLA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/vSfnEUaP_E7wtOfAH5_vLA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9477266669273376},{"business_id":"xFvkI8Uf_7NDZbChS6wSYQ","photo_id":"kteB1zHciiB7j_cA9sbRJQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/kteB1zHciiB7j_cA9sbRJQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8922988772392273},{"business_id":"xFvkI8Uf_7NDZbChS6wSYQ","photo_id":"hgjXwCkO7Rx4QFSIKUxzwQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/hgjXwCkO7Rx4QFSIKUxzwQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8878938555717468},{"business_id":"xFvkI8Uf_7NDZbChS6wSYQ","photo_id":"irKx8I9uMCr3wpLuZNJvYA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/irKx8I9uMCr3wpLuZNJvYA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8598875999450684}]},"notebook_case":null}
